608
00:36:30,348 --> 00:36:31,548
Please let it slide just this once.

609
00:36:31,548 --> 00:36:32,718
- Okay? Please.
- Do not grab me. Let go.

610
00:36:32,718 --> 00:36:35,688
- It's all my fault, so...
- I got it, stop grabbing already.

611
00:36:35,748 --> 00:36:36,748
- Please let it slide this once.
- Do not grab me.

612
00:36:36,818 --> 00:36:37,888
Do not grab me. I said stop grabbing me.

613
